{"task_id": "TASK-001", "category": "complex_reasoning", "instruction": "分析跨分布式三方账户对账数据源账目流向：已知流水表T1、银行对账单T2、清算中间凭单T3。请推导三方交易单向对账DAG偏序因果拓扑图，计算在存在单边账（差错单Err-902）情况下的不可变账期最终决算哈希，并证明不存在对账死锁环路。", "required_tools": ["ledger_topology_analyzer", "cryptographic_hasher"], "ground_truth_criteria": {"required_keywords": ["DAG偏序", "差错单", "无环性证明", "哈希存证"], "logical_assertions": ["acyclic_check == True", "reconciliation_status == 'SETTLED'"], "prohibited_keywords": ["死循环", "环路死锁"]}, "complexity_level": "L4-VeryHigh"}
{"task_id": "TASK-002", "category": "complex_reasoning", "instruction": "基于企业内部反洗钱（AML）知识图谱，审查关联账户群 A-101 到 A-109 之间的资金快速划转网络。利用拓扑排序算法识别资金最终汇聚控制人节点，推导资金分流置信度，并输出不可变拓扑判定证据。", "required_tools": ["aml_graph_tracer", "topological_sorter"], "ground_truth_criteria": {"required_keywords": ["反洗钱", "拓扑排序", "核心控制节点", "置信度上界"], "logical_assertions": ["sink_node_identified == True", "purity >= 0.95"], "prohibited_keywords": ["虚假节点", "无解"]}, "complexity_level": "L3-High"}
{"task_id": "TASK-003", "category": "multi_tool_orchestration", "instruction": "针对集群 node-eu-prod-04 突发的 P99 延迟陡增问题，依序调用微服务分布式链路追踪工具获取 Trace 日志，调用系统物理指标采集工具提取 CPU 与堆外内存占用，计算两者的 Pearson 相关系数，并定位造成阻塞的慢 RPC 调用链路与具体服务接口。", "required_tools": ["trace_log_fetcher", "system_metric_collector", "correlation_calculator"], "ground_truth_criteria": {"required_keywords": ["Trace链路", "堆外内存", "Pearson相关系数", "阻塞根因"], "logical_assertions": ["correlation_calculated == True", "bottleneck_service_isolated == True"], "prohibited_keywords": ["误诊", "未完成调用"]}, "complexity_level": "L4-VeryHigh"}
{"task_id": "TASK-004", "category": "multi_tool_orchestration", "instruction": "集群高可用主从数据库发生网络分区震荡，请编排自动化自愈工具链：1. 核验 Raft 选主租赁期是否超时；2. 触发虚拟线程断路器隔离不可达节点；3. 激活只读从库故障转移并广播拓扑变更配置；4. 校验三级冷备环形缓冲区数据完整性。", "required_tools": ["raft_lease_inspector", "vt_circuit_breaker", "failover_orchestrator", "ring_buffer_verifier"], "ground_truth_criteria": {"required_keywords": ["Raft选主", "虚拟线程断路器", "故障转移", "环形缓冲区完整性"], "logical_assertions": ["failover_success == True", "zero_data_loss == True"], "prohibited_keywords": ["主备脑裂", "数据损坏"]}, "complexity_level": "L4-VeryHigh"}
{"task_id": "TASK-005", "category": "domain_rag_inquiry", "instruction": "企业级 AI-Native RAG 知识库检索中，阿里千问 1536 维超球面向量空间要求所有嵌入满足严格 L2 单位范数归一化。请检索并阐述余弦相似度与欧氏距离之间的几何变换恒等式推导过程，说明拉普拉斯谱剪枝最优子图切分（Cheeger Cut）是如何保障多跳知识召回纯度的。", "required_tools": ["hyperspherical_rag_retriever", "spectral_cut_verifier"], "ground_truth_criteria": {"required_keywords": ["1536维", "超球面余弦几何", "恒等式", "拉普拉斯谱剪枝", "Cheeger"], "logical_assertions": ["norm_constraint_satisfied == True", "identity_verified == True"], "prohibited_keywords": ["未归一化欧氏", "几何畸变"]}, "complexity_level": "L3-High"}
{"task_id": "TASK-006", "category": "domain_rag_inquiry", "instruction": "审查 Hermes 编排平台的数据存证与密码学防侧信道安全规范。结合知识库架构，说明为什么凭单必须采用纯 Java 21 Record 不可变对象构建，散列验签为什么必须采用 MessageDigest.isEqual 常量时间比对，以及淘汰记忆的三级冷备隔离环形缓冲区如何保障可逆性与零物理误删。", "required_tools": ["security_codex_retriever", "audit_receipt_validator"], "ground_truth_criteria": {"required_keywords": ["Java 21 Record", "MessageDigest.isEqual", "常量时间防侧信道", "三级冷备环形缓冲区"], "logical_assertions": ["constant_time_verified == True", "cold_backup_guaranteed == True"], "prohibited_keywords": ["时序泄漏", "物理硬删除"]}, "complexity_level": "L3-High"}
{"task_id": "TASK-007", "category": "fault_diagnosis_healing", "instruction": "生产环境数据库连接池出现 HikariPool-1 - Connection is not available 超时异常。请诊断：分析由于长事务阻塞与缺乏超时熔断导致的级联雪崩；生成基于状态机守护的临时动态扩容与泄漏检测配置，并输出防止级联雪崩的平滑限流降级方案。", "required_tools": ["pool_leak_detector", "transaction_block_analyzer", "rate_limiter_configurator"], "ground_truth_criteria": {"required_keywords": ["HikariPool连接泄漏", "长事务阻塞", "自适应限流", "动态平滑降级"], "logical_assertions": ["root_cause_identified == True", "mitigation_plan_valid == True"], "prohibited_keywords": ["重启无用", "盲目扩容"]}, "complexity_level": "L4-VeryHigh"}
{"task_id": "TASK-008", "category": "fault_diagnosis_healing", "instruction": "Agent 在 ReAct 执行循环中调用工具出现死循环与假熔断故障。法医级分析：为什么传统的滑动计数器会因为并发时序漂移产生暂态 W+1 幽灵计数假阳性？Hermes 的 ReActStrictWindowCycleGuard 是如何通过淘汰时序前置与追踪二元状态转移对消解 A->B->A->B 交错循环的？", "required_tools": ["cycle_guard_inspector", "markov_transition_tracer"], "ground_truth_criteria": {"required_keywords": ["幽灵计数", "淘汰时序前置", "二元状态转移对", "ReActStrictWindowCycleGuard"], "logical_assertions": ["ghost_count_explained == True", "transition_pair_verified == True"], "prohibited_keywords": ["偶发误报", "无法解释"]}, "complexity_level": "L3-High"}
